            "review_title": "Review at Huong Vi Xua",
            "review_text": "Meg\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia137 contributions\n0\nHome cooked food at it's best!\nJun 2018 • Business\nWe were a group of five for a business dinner. The place is clean, beautifully decorated to give you a warm welcome in Vietnam.\nI love all the dishes served! We had stir fry morning glory, grilled squid, mango salad, omelette, clam soup, steamed vegetables and rice. For drinks we had pomelo juice. \nThe whole area is very beautiful, away from the city crowd. \nGood place to eat if you are nearby.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 12, 2018",
